&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mirakl:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2012, Mirakl has been at the forefront of marketplace innovation, empowering every business to compete in the platform economy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, Mirakl’s operating system combines an enterprise marketplace solution (Mirakl Platform) that enables retailers and B2B organizations to launch, scale, and operate marketplaces and dropship, AI-powered multichannel selling (Mirakl Connect), retail media (Mirakl Ads) and an agentic commerce infrastructure (Mirakl Nexus).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With dual headquarters in Boston and Paris, Mirakl helps a global ecosystem of 450+ marketplaces (B2C and B2B) and a network of over 100k third-party marketplace sellers. Brands like Macy’s, Decathlon, Carrefour, Asos, and Airbus Helicopters use Mirakl to grow their businesses in new and remarkable ways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mirakl.com&quot;&gt;www.mirakl.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mirakl in Numbers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗓️ Founded in 2012 | Member of French Tech Next40&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👥 750+ employees in 9 offices worldwide: Paris, Barcelona, Bordeaux, Boston, London, Munich, New York, Sydney, Tokyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🇫🇷 350+ Mirakl Tech teams members mainly based in France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⚙️ 5 Saas Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Mirakl means accelerating your career alongside ambitious, passionate, and supportive colleagues. We&#39;re proud of the diversity of backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences that make our teams unique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our 5 values guide how we collaborate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💡&lt;strong&gt; Work Hard Together:&lt;/strong&gt; Teamwork and collaboration are the foundation of our success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏆 &lt;strong&gt;Get Things Done: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We prioritize action and efficiency for impactful results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Go Above &amp;amp; Beyond:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; We tackle challenges proactively and always aim for excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 &lt;strong&gt;Succeed Through Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge sharing and continuous learning are core to our culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Satisfy &amp;amp; Empower Clients:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re committed to our clients&#39; success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our Channel Integration team within Mirakl Connect.. We are expanding this team to scale Mirakl Connect&#39;s channel coverage and accelerate the delivery of new in-house marketplace connectors across the platform. Working closely with our Channel Integration PM, Engineering, and other Connect product teams, you&#39;ll drive the growth of Mirakl Connect by launching new strategic sales channels while raising the bar on connector quality and delivery speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The role requires to be based 4 days a week in our Paris HQ.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end delivery of new channel connectors: from discovery and scoping with external channels through build, launch, hypercare, and handover to Support, in close collaboration with Engineering and Architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product scoping and execution for your connectors: ground decisions in seller needs, marketplace API requirements, and platform constraints. Write epics and user stories, organize sprints, manage dependencies with other Connect product teams, and track execution end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect launch quality and run beta pilots: define readiness criteria, coordinate functional and technical validation, run beta/pilot phases closely with sellers, and co-own go/no-go decisions with Product and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own channel documentation and enablement: create and maintain channel documentation for sellers and Support, and collaborate with Product Marketing (PMM) to deliver channel enablement ahead of launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the integration flywheel: turn lessons from each connector into reusable standards, playbooks, and platform improvements, measuring success through time-to-build, delivery predictability, and time to stabilization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in product management, program management, or technical project delivery in a SaaS or platform environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering several complex integration projects in parallel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in channel management, e-commerce, marketplaces, or complex software integration models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with APIs, event-driven systems, and software integration lifecycles — you don&#39;t need to code, but you know how to ask the right questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product judgment: ability to lead discovery, challenge requirements, and make pragmatic scope trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder management: influential and constructive, able to build evidence-based points of view and defend them with Product, Engineering, Architecture, external channel contacts, and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outcome-driven: holds partners accountable while building productive, long-term relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven mindset: comfortable tracking KPIs, measuring delivery quality, and iterating based on insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and adaptable: at ease working cross-functionally in a fast-moving international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Productboard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jira&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;professional proficiency in French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;professional proficiency in English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7. Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We warmly encourage you to apply to any of our roles, even if you think you&#39;re not an exact match.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please click the &quot;Apply&quot; button to submit your application, this helps us make the best possible assessment and get back to you as quickly as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;45-minute call&lt;/strong&gt; with Mathilde, Talent Acquisition Specialist to discuss your key projects, and present the position in detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1-hour business discussion&lt;/strong&gt; with François Crossette, VP Product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1 x 45-minute STAR interview&lt;/strong&gt; to assess your alignment with our values and meet our Director of Engineering, Jean-Yves Cazac&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More information about our recruitment philosophy 👉&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/3-tips-pour-briller-en-entretien-star-chez-mirakl-kauffmann-0ojzf/&quot;&gt; 3 tips to shine in STAR interviews at Mirakl&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome collaborators with their diverse perspectives and experiences to power us forward. These often far exceed conventional job requirements and help us create a culture of continuous learning. If you’re ready to join a global leader powering digital transformation for 450+ of the world’s most innovative retailers and B2B organizations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our recruitment process, Mirakl processes your personal data to review and manage your application and, where appropriate, to consider your profile for future opportunities. You can exercise your data protection rights at any time, and as further detailed in our policies. For more information about how we process your personal data and your rights, please consult our Recruitment Privacy Notice, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in English and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/fr-FR/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in French.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use Artificial Intelligence (AI) solutions to help streamline our hiring process, including screening applications, analyzing resumes, and assessing responses. While AI helps us work efficiently, all final hiring decisions are made by humans. For more information, visit our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI Guidelines for Candidates and Interviews&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Purpose/Mission - The role owns the infrastructure, network and cybersecurity workstream for&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PHENOGY&#39;s corporate IT infrastructure (cloud, network, endpoints, identities and access) and its interfaces with the Battery Energy Storage System (BESS) product environment. It translates business, product, operational, customer and regulatory requirements into secure, resilient and auditable infrastructure and security controls across the BESS lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cybersecurity governance and the Information Security Management System (ISO/IEC 27001)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security architecture of BESS connectivity (EMS, BMS, gateways, IoT, APIs) and secure data exchange with partners such as Heidelberg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backup, business continuity and disaster recovery for critical systems (BESS/EMS, ERP, CRM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management of infrastructure and cybersecurity projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Tasks &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as internal-facing and technical owner of the IT infrastructure and security landscape: network, firewalling and web filtering, Microsoft 365/Azure tenants, identity and access management, endpoints, backup, and secure remote/supplier access to BESS sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the asset and configuration inventory, network and security architecture documentation, risk register, vulnerability backlog, security policies and the infrastructure/security roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the risk management and vulnerability management cycle: periodic assessments, prioritisation, patching and remediation tracking across IT systems, applications, APIs and BESS connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and operate security monitoring, incident response, escalation paths, maintenance windows and problem management, together with external service providers (MSP/MSSP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define backup and retention policies (daily, monthly, yearly; 10+ years for critical data), offline/immutable backups, disaster-recovery runbooks and regular restore and DR tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define secure segmentation between corporate IT and the OT/BESS environment and secure remote access for O&amp;amp;M and field service, aligned with IEC 62443 concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide infrastructure, system-integration and cybersecurity support to the After Sales &amp;amp; Service framework once operational responsibility moves to the Service Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support B2B customer and audit requests: security questionnaires, tender requirements and compliance evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on when required: configure firewall rules, endpoint and identity policies, backup jobs and cloud security settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key Projects (2027 portfolio)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Management &amp;amp; Vulnerability Assessment (Jan–Feb 2027): assess risks and vulnerabilities across all systems and deliver a prioritised remediation plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BESS Security Architecture II (Jan–Mar 2027): secure the BESS architecture and data exchange with Heidelberg, building on the current BESS security baseline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Continuity &amp;amp; Recovery System (Feb–Apr 2027): offline backup and disaster recovery for critical systems such as BESS/EMS, ERP and CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network Improvements (Feb–Jun 2027): introduce firewalling and web filtering, which are not yet in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Threat Protection – ISO 27001 (Mar–May 2027): protect network and application traffic, including APIs and IP-based access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ISO 27001 Enhancements (ongoing): close control gaps, maintain policies and evidence, and prepare for audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take over operation of granular backup and advanced endpoint management, and provide security input to the PHENOGY IoT solution POC (BMS/EMS communication and REST APIs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Core Competencies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead assigned infrastructure and cybersecurity projects from initiation through closure, using structured scope, schedule, budget, dependency, risk, issue, decision and change control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create project charters, work breakdown structures, delivery plans, security requirements, test and DR-test plans, cutover plans, acceptance records and handover packages to operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate external suppliers (MSP/MSSP, network and firewall vendors, cloud providers, BESS/EMS partners) to resolve cross-functional blockers and escalate material decisions to the Head of IT and relevant governance bodies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide concise status reporting on progress, milestones, risk posture, vulnerabilities, incidents, suppliers and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree or equivalent professional experience in information technology, computer science, information security, engineering or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in IT infrastructure and cybersecurity management, including responsibility for delivering projects, ideally in an international mid-sized company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with network security (firewalls, VPN, segmentation, web filtering, IDS/IPS), Microsoft 365 / Entra ID / Intune / Defender, and backup and disaster recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running risk assessments, vulnerability management and security incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience implementing or maintaining an ISMS according to ISO/IEC 27001.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating technical suppliers and multidisciplinary stakeholders across business, IT and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand operational technology and industrial-system boundaries without assuming ownership of safety engineering or embedded-control design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong documentation, risk management and executive-status reporting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional English; German or another relevant operating language is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strongly preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience securing Battery Energy Storage Systems, EMS, BMS, SCADA, PLC, PCS/inverters, industrial gateways, IoT or energy-data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of IEC 62443, NIS2 and the EU Cyber Resilience Act in mixed IT/OT environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Azure networking and security, Microsoft Sentinel / Defender XDR and enterprise firewall platforms (e.g. Fortinet, Palo Alto, Check Point).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with industrial protocols and secure integration patterns, including Modbus TCP, OPC UA, MQTT, REST APIs, API gateways and certificate/PKI management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with backup and DR solutions for cloud and hybrid environments, including immutable and offline backups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized credentials such as CISSP, CISM, ISO 27001 Lead Implementer/Auditor, GICSP, PMP, PRINCE2 or ITIL are advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decision-making authority: Approves infrastructure and security changes, firewall and access rules and security exceptions within the agreed policy framework and budget; may isolate systems or accounts during a security incident; escalates risk acceptance and major investments to the Head of IT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting Line: Reporting to Head of IT Direct reports: none (functional lead of external infrastructure and security providers)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workload: 100% - Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel: approx. 10% – PHENOGY offices, BESS customer sites and partner/supplier sites as required&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Become part of our eco-passionate expert team - a first-class team all around.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Benefit from flexible work hours as well as remote and on-site working in a modern sustainable office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Enjoy various events, an amazing coffee machine, and the occasional coffee from our CEO (acting Barista)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;At PHENOGY, we highly value diversity, equality, and inclusion. It makes our company stronger. &lt;strong&gt;Our philosophy: one mindset, many minds.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;For recruitment and staffing agencies: PHENOGY works exclusively with selected recruitment partners under formal agreements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We do not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from agencies and assume no liability for claims made by unauthorized recruiters regarding our recruitment processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Product Team is looking for a passionate and dedicated colleague to join them and build world-class products to move the performance marketing industry forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will work closely with both internal and external developers to build plugins, connectors and other integrations including with e-commerce and customer data platforms. You will support the product backlog management and ensure that our products meet customer needs and business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting role where you will build and maintain a deep understanding of the e-commerce landscape and industry trends.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you care about delivering products that customers love, enjoy working with different cultures, and meeting people from around the world, this position is a great opportunity for you. Join our team at our Product Hubs in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;London, Amsterdam or Milan, &lt;/strong&gt;or work from another country where Awin has an office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In this role, you will collaborate with product managers to manage the backlog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will liaise between internal and external engineers, the UX team, and stakeholders to ensure clear communication of product requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will monitor product performance metrics and generate reports to support data-driven decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will partner with customer-facing teams to gather customer feedback and insights, and use that feedback to inform product development decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will identify opportunities with product peers to further add value to our plugins and various platform integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work with the Product Marketing team to communicate releases and drive adoption of existing and new products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will develop and maintain a deep understanding of the e-commerce, customer-data platform landscape, and industry trends to inform product strategy for platform integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a bachelor’s degree in Business, Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent relevant work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have first experience or curiosity about working in product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience or high-level understanding of Ecommerce or similar platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable with web technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are data driven and possess analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable in communicating with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are self-motivated, organised, capable of prioritising work and focusing on important tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;RichTextList-bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-Week&lt;/strong&gt;: We prioritise your mental health and wellbeing by offering you a four-day Flexi-Week (with one lighter or completely disconnected day per week) at full pay, with no reduction to your annual holiday allowance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexi-office&lt;/strong&gt;: We offer an international culture and flexibility through our hybrid/remote working scheme which is designed to foster a culture of mutual trust and working flexibility.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Expense Contribution &amp;amp; Remote Working Furniture&lt;/strong&gt;: You will receive a monthly allowance to cover part of your running costs, as well as a furniture package to support you in setting up a comfortable workspace when working from home.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;: With our support and access to various initiatives and sports offers, you can focus on your mental and physical wellbeing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development&lt;/strong&gt;: We’ve built our extensive training suite, Awin Academy, to cover a wide range of skills that support your professional and personal growth, with trainings conveniently packaged to help your overall development.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation TypographyPresentation--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Appreciation&lt;/strong&gt;: Thank and reward colleagues by sending them a voucher through our peer-to-peer recognition programme.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
