&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On our path to becoming the most visited online curated marketplace for special objects, our Engineering team is on a mission to deliver the best experience across our platforms by building best-in-class products for search and discovery, bidding, curation, logistics, payments, and support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a scale-up tackling customer-facing challenges at high scale, with 75,000 auctions per week and more than 10 million visitors per month. As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Backend Engineer&lt;/em&gt;, you’ll support one of our three verticals - &lt;strong&gt;Demand&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Supply&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;Fulfilment&lt;/strong&gt; - improving and delivering product innovations for our platform.&lt;br&gt;Working in a small, fully autonomous, and highly collaborative Agile team, you will build scalable, maintainable, and resilient microservices and features. That’s why we’re looking for developers who share ideas, explore options, and communicate openly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of a team with end-to-end responsibility for its own microservices, collaborating across disciplines to build, operate, and continuously improve our products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt; by designing, developing, testing, deploying, maintaining, and improving scalable microservices and features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own what you deliver&lt;/strong&gt;, taking responsibility for the quality, resilience, and maintainability of your team’s services throughout their lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across disciplines&lt;/strong&gt; while closely working with product designers, product owners, and frontend, backend, and mobile engineers to share ideas and deliver product innovations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve how we work&lt;/strong&gt;, identifying opportunities to make our engineering processes more effective and efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen our engineering culture&lt;/strong&gt; by documenting and advocating for development best practices across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise product quality&lt;/strong&gt; by fixing bugs and refactoring the codebase where necessary to keep our products reliable and maintainable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and experiment&lt;/strong&gt; by testing new technologies and participating in Technical Week - a week dedicated to creativity, innovation, and knowledge sharing across domains after every two product sprints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand the full lifecycle of web development, identify opportunities, explore solutions, and keep customer needs at the center of your work. Our stack is mainly focused on Ruby; however, prior Ruby experience is not essential if you’re passionate about learning new things.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Strong software engineering foundations&lt;/span&gt;: 7+ years of software development experience, specifically with object-oriented programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Relevant product experience&lt;/span&gt;: 3+ years of experience working with customer-facing products in industries such as e-commerce, fintech, or SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Backend service expertise&lt;/span&gt;: Experience designing, implementing, and deploying backend services with a focus on high availability, low latency, and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;API and data knowledge&lt;/span&gt;: A good understanding of API design, SQL, and relational databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Clear communication&lt;/span&gt;: Excellent English communication skills and comfort raising concerns, sharing ideas, and documenting your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Collaborative mindset&lt;/span&gt;: You contribute to the team, take initiative, and step in to help when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Solution-oriented thinking&lt;/span&gt;: You actively identify opportunities and explore alternative approaches to solving problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Commitment to growth&lt;/span&gt;: You take ownership of developing your skills by learning new technologies and seeking new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our engineers work in small, fully autonomous, and highly collaborative Agile teams aligned with one of three verticals: Demand, Supply, or Fulfilment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teams are responsible for their own microservices from design and development through deployment, maintenance, and improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineers collaborate closely with product designers, product owners, and frontend, backend, and mobile colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value bold thinking, curiosity, openness, initiative, and a strong customer focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Week creates dedicated space for experimentation, creativity, innovation, and knowledge sharing across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Where You&#39;ll Be&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;Hybrid&lt;/em&gt; role based in Amsterdam. &lt;strong&gt;You will work from our &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Amsterdam HQ&lt;/span&gt; a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are only considering candidates who are already based in&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;the &lt;strong&gt;Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;relocation support is not available for this position&lt;/span&gt;. We can, however, &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;provide visa transfer from current Dutch employer&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;In Return&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of an enthusiastic, highly motivated team of &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;800+ Catawikians&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A competitive &lt;u&gt;Annual Gross Base Salary&lt;/u&gt; depending on your level, competencies, and overall experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;A &lt;u&gt;Work From Home Allowance&lt;/u&gt; to help with your monthly household bills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Commuting&lt;/u&gt; between your home and our office is covered by Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Amazing &lt;u&gt;Office&lt;/u&gt; right in the centre of Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;PHENOGY is a dynamic, fast-growing company specializing in innovative energy storage solutions. We develop, manufacture, and distribute advanced energy storage systems worldwide.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scriptor-paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of IT, you will ensure that Phenogy&#39;s IT-Technology foundation is secure, reliable, scalable, and capable of supporting rapid international growth. You will own the company&#39;s core IT operations, infrastructure, enterprise applications, cybersecurity, workplace technology, and service delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role focuses on operational excellence and business enablement. You will ensure that employees, strategic partners on the supply-chain as well as on the sales-channel side, manufacturing operations, and commercial teams can work effectively through robust technology platforms while maintaining high standards of security, compliance, and service quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your tasks &amp;amp; responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute Phenogy&#39;s global IT roadmap, ensuring stable and scalable technology operations across Switzerland, Germany, the United States, Singapore and future locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own enterprise applications and business systems, including ERP, collaboration platforms, identity management, endpoint management, and future MES integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain secure, cloud-based infrastructure and workplace technology environments that support global collaboration and operational continuity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cybersecurity, information security, risk management, business continuity, disaster recovery, and compliance initiatives aligned with industry best practices and future certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage external IT service providers, technology vendors, MSPs, and cybersecurity partners while ensuring service quality, performance, and cost efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead the internal IT organization, including IT Operations, Service Management, and Cybersecurity capabilities, while defining future sourcing and staffing strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish IT governance, service management processes, SLAs, asset management, and operational KPIs to support a growing international organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Operations, Supply Chain, PMO, Quality, Finance, and Commercial functions to ensure technology effectively supports business execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Must have&#39;s:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of leadership experience in IT, Infrastructure, Enterprise Applications, or Technology Operations within manufacturing, industrial, energy, or technology-driven environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing enterprise applications, cloud infrastructure, cybersecurity, networks, and global technology operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing and supporting ERP environments and business-critical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of cybersecurity frameworks, IT governance, risk management, and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage external service providers, technology vendors, and outsourcing partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to translate operational requirements into scalable technology solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in English; German a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&#39;s:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting international manufacturing operations and global supply chains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft Dynamics, MES environments, or industrial IoT integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of ISO 27001, NIST, TISAX, or similar security frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling technology operations in high-growth organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to renewable energy, battery systems, or industrial technology environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Technopark Lucerne with remote and home-office opportunities or Bremen, Germany&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Readiness&lt;/strong&gt;: 20-30%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workload&lt;/strong&gt;: 100%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports &lt;/strong&gt;: COO&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Become part of our eco-passionate expert team - a first-class team all around.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Benefit from flexible work hours as well as remote and on-site working in a modern sustainable office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Enjoy various events, an amazing coffee machine, and the occasional coffee from our CEO (acting Barista)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;At PHENOGY, we highly value diversity, equality, and inclusion. It makes our company stronger. &lt;strong&gt;Our philosophy: one mindset, many minds.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;For recruitment and staffing agencies: PHENOGY works exclusively with selected recruitment partners under formal agreements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We do not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from agencies and assume no liability for claims made by unauthorized recruiters regarding our recruitment processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a dynamic, hands-on Senior Product Delivery Manager at HelloFresh. This role is pivotal to the future of our fulfillment network. You will be at the helm of further developing and deploying a high-profile, highly complex strategic project that fundamentally redefines our production methods and capabilities across our DCs.&lt;br&gt;Working closely with Tech and Operations Leadership, you will be responsible for taking our new, next-generation production setup and refining its processes, equipment, and layouts. Once optimized, you will lead the charge in deploying this new operational blueprint into other DCs across our international markets.&lt;br&gt;This is not a traditional desk-bound product role; it requires a strong operational background, deep understanding of physical process design, and the ability to bridge the gap between high-level strategy and on-the-ground execution. The international role will be based in our Berlin office and will involve frequent travel to our local warehouses across markets and potentially extended stays during roll-out periods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process and Equipment Design:&lt;/strong&gt; You will actively design, evaluate, and refine DC layouts, operational workflows, and physical equipment setups for our next-generation production models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Deployment &amp;amp; Rollout:&lt;/strong&gt; Working cross-functionally, you will be the driving force for the end-to-end implementation and deployment of production technologies. Including this complex new production model across multiple international fulfillment centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lean Management &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; You will apply Lean principles to continuously test, tweak, and optimize the operational setup and production capacity before, during, and after site rollouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You will act as the central node between global engineering, local operations teams, tech, and senior leadership. You will manage expectations, align priorities, and ensure smooth execution across a matrixed international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; You will identify, prioritize, structure, and solve an array of complex physical and systematic business problems on the shop floor, using analytics, engineering principles, and strong business judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; You will support the development of rollout strategies and produce the resulting project plans, ensuring that we deploy at scale without disrupting ongoing operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation and Standardization:&lt;/strong&gt; You will drive towards clear and structured project documentation, clearly defining and outlining the solutions, requirements, … You will help us create standard deployment playbooks which speed up bringing our solutions to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong track record within a production, manufacturing, or supply chain environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess highly specific, demonstrated experience in DC layout design, process design, and equipment design/optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methodology: You have deep expertise in Lean Management principles and continuous improvement methodologies within a physical operational setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership: You have exceptional project delivery and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to influence and guide teams in an environment that requires intense cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Academic Record:&lt;/strong&gt; An excellent academic record with a degree from a top-tier college or University (Engineering, Supply Chain, or Business degrees strongly preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience at an (operational / management) consulting firm with a focus on manufacturing/operations projects is a big plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a demonstrated ability to deliver heavy-hitting impact and work highly independently in an unstructured, fast-moving, and constantly evolving high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobility:&lt;/strong&gt; You have an interest and willingness to frequently travel abroad (~50%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#PRODUCT #OPERATIONS&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our EMEA Marketing team is a dynamic, fast-growing group that loves turning customers into enthusiastic Stripe advocates. We work hand-in-hand with our Sales team to build demand, help users get the most out of our products, and craft marketing plans that truly resonate with local audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a lot still to build, and we’re tackling it as a diverse, international team that thrives on collaboration, bold innovation, and genuine curiosity. If you love to learn and want to make a meaningful impact, we’d love to have you join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior individual contributor, you’ll align regional and global marketing teams around shared priorities for EMEA Velocity, secure investment to deliver them, and balance global strategy with regional needs. You’ll directly lead high-priority initiatives across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll shape how Stripe grows its Velocity segment across EMEA, with a particular focus on winning and expanding relationships with priority commercial accounts. You’ll combine regional strategy with hands-on field marketing, building programs that generate demand and accelerate pipeline across different markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the primary marketing partner on the EMEA Velocity leadership team, you’ll own the regional marketing strategy and investment plan. You’ll work closely with Sales leadership to identify the biggest opportunities across markets, decide where marketing can make the greatest difference, and turn those priorities into measurable business results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll lead account-based programs, executive engagement, and market-relevant campaigns for priority commercial accounts, bringing together regional and global teams to deliver them. Your programs will engage senior decision makers and operational leaders on reducing developer complexity, improving conversion, and increasing the return on their financial infrastructure. You’ll also partner with Demand Generation on scaled digital demand campaigns and programs, connecting those efforts with regional business priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior individual contributor, you’ll lead through influence across markets and teams, aligning Sales, Demand Generation, Product Marketing, and Global Campaigns around a shared plan. You’ll balance regional priorities with local customer needs, use results to guide investment, and build approaches that can scale across EMEA. You’ll help shape the marketing approach and directly lead the initiatives where regional context and ownership matter most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and own the integrated marketing strategy for the Velocity segment across EMEA, turning business goals, market dynamics, customer needs, and competitors into clear priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional Sales and Sales Development (SDR) leadership to set shared priorities, take part in pipeline reviews, and steer marketing investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build full-funnel campaigns around the problems businesses are trying to solve, such as taking payments online, growing recurring revenue, and getting paid faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-touch field marketing, targeted account-based programs, and executive events, including dinners and roadshows, for priority commercial accounts. Partner with Demand Generation on scaled digital demand campaigns and programs, connecting those programs with regional Sales priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-market with the SaaS Platforms and Partner teams to reach merchants through the software they already use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Stripe’s brand with these businesses through customer stories, executive engagement, and industry initiatives, and lead the programs yourself where local context and senior ownership matter most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the regional marketing budget and use pipeline generation, pipeline progression, priority-account engagement, and ROI to guide investment. Partner with relevant teams to measure contributions to product adoption and customer advocacy, and use results to prioritise, scale, or change programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring regional and global teams (including Demand Generation, Product Marketing, and Global Campaigns) together to deliver the plan, and adapt global strategy to local buyer expectations, regulation, and the competitive landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re an experienced B2B marketing leader who has owned an integrated marketing strategy across a country, region, or comparably broad portfolio. You can set clear direction, make clear commercial trade-offs, and partner credibly with senior Sales and go-to-market (GTM) leaders—all while staying close enough to execution to turn strategy into measurable business results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements for the role. If you meet them, we encourage you to apply. Preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of B2B marketing experience, including ownership of integrated marketing strategy and budget for a region or broad portfolio in tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GTM business partnering: Proven track record partnering with senior Sales and GTM leaders to turn commercial targets into marketing plans and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scaled and high-touch marketing: Experience running both scaled digital demand and high-touch account-based marketing for larger prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial accountability: Success generating pipeline, accelerating deal velocity, and managing multi-program budgets tied to clear ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional leadership: Demonstrated ability to align regional and global teams (Demand Generation, Product Marketing, and Communications) without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy and hands-on delivery: Comfort moving between multi-quarter planning and delivering key initiatives yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive communication: Strong written and verbal skills, with the ability to explain technical products in business terms and present recommendations to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain knowledge: Experience in payments, fintech, embedded finance, ecommerce, or high-growth B2B SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ecosystem and platform GTM: Experience marketing to software platforms, SaaS businesses, marketplaces, or building joint co-marketing programs with technology and ecosystem partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positioning &amp;amp; localization: Proven ability to take category or business-model positioning and translate it into regional and local-market programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive advocacy: A track record of building customer advocacy and influence strategies with senior commercial stakeholders (Founders, CEOs, and CFOs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builder mindset: Comfort building marketing approaches where the playbook, tooling, or route to impact is still taking shape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Flexport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, we believe global trade can move the human race forward. That’s why it’s our mission to make global commerce so easy there will be more of it. We’re shaping the future of a $10T industry with solutions powered by innovative technology and exceptional people. Today, companies of all sizes—from emerging brands to Fortune 500s—use Flexport technology to move more than $19B of merchandise across 112 countries a year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The recent global supply chain crisis has put Flexport center stage as we continue to play a pivotal role in how goods move around the world. We are proud to have the support of the best investors in the game who believe in our mission, solutions and people. Ready to tackle global challenges that impact business, society, and the environment? Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Customs Matters More Than Ever&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;International trade is under more pressure than ever before. With tariffs, shifting regulations, and geopolitical uncertainty, customs has gone from a back-office function to a boardroom priority. The recent trade crisis—sparked by Trump-era tariffs—has made customs the single most complex challenge for global businesses. For many, it’s the difference between keeping supply chains moving or grinding them to a halt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That’s where we come in. The &lt;strong&gt;Customs Technology team&lt;/strong&gt; at Flexport is leading the charge. We are building the systems that help entrepreneurs and global brands navigate complexity, stay compliant, and keep the world’s goods flowing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The opportunity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customs brokerage is one of the largest, most under-innovated opportunities in logistics. Legacy customs brokers are stuck with outdated systems and manual processes—they simply can’t adapt fast enough.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flexport is growing fast because we’re different. We are the only big tech company in the space, and the only freight forwarder that got founded after the launch of Netscape. Being a tech company, we can move much faster than our competitors, and give our customers the service they expect in this day and age. We can deploy things like LLM agents at scale, in an industry that is ripe to be disrupted by this technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things we ❤️&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraging AI in a safe way to eliminate mundane work for customs brokers and automate customs every step of the way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modeling complex and ambiguous domains into fully automated workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building highly performant and reliable Kotlin services on our cutting-edge infrastructure platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with end users across the globe to create the best possible product: removing toil and surfacing interesting cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with business partners and product managers to distill complex business problems into elegant technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on systems that represent the real-world intricacies of logistics entities and the process of moving cargo in and out of countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and launch products rapidly and incrementally. We ship to production dozens of times per day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Geek out about shipping, customs regulations and logistics. (We do this often.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Figure out the most efficient way for our customers and partners to participate in the process of moving freight across borders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build deep, complex integrations with government agencies and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate archaic customs filing processes and save the operations team thousands of phone calls per week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver supply chain insights to logistics teams via a world-class analytics experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create beautiful and efficient domain models for the incredibly complex world of freight forwarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;≥ 5 years of experience writing software, and a strong engineering background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A love of simple, well-tested code that is easy to extend and hard to break.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to convey technical ideas in common terms to business partners, product managers, designers and engineers alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action. When you see a problem, you solve it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to develop your tooling repertoire. We are tech-agnostic regarding candidate background, but our platform is built with Ruby.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Non-optional: an aptitude for learning quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We come to the office at two to three times a week to hang out, have lunch, white board, and collaborate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have the latest and greatest hardware and software for you to work with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re agile, but not married to a single doctrine like scrum. The teams decide how they work best.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stack: we’re coming from a React/Flow + Ruby on Rails monolith, and moving to React/Typescript, Kotlin Microservices on Kubernetes. We also use and love GraphQL, GRPC, Postgres, Kafka and Snowflake&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to contribute to one of the fastest-growing companies, where you’ll have the chance to create a global impact while being a part of a&amp;nbsp; thriving multinational environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily catered lunches incl. vegetarian options, breakfast, snacks and soft drinks available in our office on daily basis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commute expenses: Flexport will cover&amp;nbsp; home-office commuting costs for employees living outside of Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days as vacation days based on full time employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: Flexport offers a collective health insurance plan including a basic package and any available additional packages. Your monthly premium is fully paid by Flexport.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A defined pension contribution scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity program: every team member becomes a shareholder, aligning our success with yours. As a private company in a multi-trillion dollar industry, you have a direct stake in our collective growth and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program through Aetna Resources for Living: Flexport provides an employer-sponsored program at no cost to you and your household members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave benefit: Flexport is here to support you and your families in one of the most important times in life – the birth of a child! Our parental leave program allows both mothers and partners to take time off from work for pregnancy, childbirth, and to bond with your new child.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
