&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information&amp;nbsp;regarding&amp;nbsp;our comprehensive benefits,&amp;nbsp;see the benefits section.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;OTE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€110.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€130.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€77.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Incentive Compensation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€33.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€39.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson’s Intelligence &amp;amp; Insights capability builds the data infrastructure, pipelines and AI-enabled workflows that power communications measurement and impact reporting at scale. Reporting directly to JT Joseph within the Intelligence &amp;amp; Insights practice and based in London, UK (Hybrid working policy), this role is central to leading the technical development of Fount, Burson’s flagship communications intelligence platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for translating product vision and technical specifications into robust, scalable data engineering and business intelligence solutions. Working closely with product leadership, you will contribute technical insights and architectural recommendations that help shape the platform&#39;s future evolution. You will operate within a structured Agile team managed in Jira, where product vision, priorities and roadmaps are set by Product Owners, while your core focus is executing this vision to the highest engineering standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will serve as the lead engineer responsible for building, maintaining and enhancing Fount, Burson’s custom data pipeline and database layer for communications reporting. Fount enables analysts to configure client monitoring subscriptions, Boolean searches, data ingestion and AI enrichment through an analyst-facing configuration layer. Under the direction of product leadership, you will execute technical deliverables that make the platform more reliable, scalable and seamless for non-technical users to configure and operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual-contributor role with technical leadership and mentoring responsibility, rather than a formal people-management position. You will directly mentor a junior engineer while providing technical peer support and alignment across the wider engineering team. The position combines strategic engineering with hands-on delivery across major pillars:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Architecture&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., pipeline design, engineering standards, technical reviews, technical debt refactoring, mentoring)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fount Platform &amp;amp; Data Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., ETL/ELT pipelines, Python services, SQL layers, API integrations, cloud infrastructure, cost &amp;amp; performance optimization)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyst Enablement &amp;amp; AI Integrations&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., NocoDB configuration, Boolean ingestion, LLM enrichment frameworks, MCP &amp;amp; provider-hosted integrations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical design, architectural standards, and delivery of business-critical data pipelines, services, and platform components across media monitoring and communications data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product Owners in an Agile Jira environment to assess technical feasibility, evaluate trade-offs, and translate product requirements into maintainable, scalable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain production-ready Python services, SQL transformation layers, star-schema data models, and API integrations across relational databases and cloud storage (Azure Data Lake).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise pipeline performance, system reliability, compute efficiency, and AI token costs, while establishing robust monitoring, logging, alerting, and incident-response practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance Fount’s analyst-facing configuration layer (Boolean searches, API ingestion rules, NocoDB workflows) to streamline analyst setup and reduce routine engineering intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operationalise AI-enabled enrichment frameworks (classification, summarisation, sentiment, topic detection, LLMs, MCP-enabled integrations) with strict quality assurance, governance, and cost controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver custom data engineering solutions for specialized client requirements, integrating internal, API-driven, and third-party research datasets into scalable reporting workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior engineers through code reviews, pairing, architectural guidance, and knowledge-sharing, while systematically refactoring technical debt and maintaining operational runbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience designing, building, and operating production data platforms, star-schema data models, and complex ELT/ETL pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in Python and SQL, including clean object-oriented design, Pandas, query optimization, and REST API integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience within the Microsoft Azure ecosystem (Azure Data Factory, Azure SQL, ADLS), Azure DevOps, Git, CI/CD pipelines, and automated testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in system reliability engineering, production troubleshooting, logging/monitoring, and performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated capability mentoring junior engineers and elevating team capabilities through code reviews, technical standards, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile execution expertise using Jira, partnering closely with Product Owners to evaluate technical trade-offs and manage competing roadmap priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern AI &amp;amp; integration frameworks, including LLM enrichment workflows, semi-structured formats (e.g., Parquet), NoSQL, and provider-hosted or MCP-enabled integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to complementary technologies, such as low-code UI tools (NocoDB/Airtable), Infrastructure as Code (Terraform/Terragrunt), Power BI/DAX, or communications measurement data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-SF2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build the engineering foundations that enable AI agents to work with enterprise tools and workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work focuses on the &lt;strong&gt;Agent Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, which coordinates agent execution and provides controlled access to tools and execution environments. Our platform directly powers the Celonis Context Model, meaning we work as a product team in close collaboration with product managers and other roles rather than an infrastructure team. Expect to work close to the end-user experience, shipping tangible product improvements in rapid iteration loops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you will design, build, and operate backend services that serve the platform with the AI capabilities they need to perform useful work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own complex features from understanding the problem and defining the technical approach through implementation, deployment, and ongoing improvement. The work combines Python development, asynchronous execution, data processing, and practical application of large language models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help the team make thoughtful architectural decisions, balance delivery with maintainability, and turn evolving requirements into dependable software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build agent execution capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop services for agent sessions, execution state, streaming responses, tool integrations, and controlled execution environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for reliable execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Handle concurrency, cancellation, retries, partial failures, and recovery so that long-running operations behave predictably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect customer data and actions:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement authorization, tenant isolation, input validation, and appropriate controls around agent access to tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own complex features through delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Clarify requirements with stakeholders, document design choices, break work into manageable increments, and follow through to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure and improve quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop automated tests and evaluations, investigate failures, and improve latency, resource usage, and operational visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen the engineering foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; Refactor complex code where needed, improve development and deployment tooling, and contribute reusable APIs and libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help the team succeed:&lt;/strong&gt; Review code, share knowledge, support less experienced engineers, and work with product and engineering partners to define success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial professional experience building and operating backend software with Python, typically 5+ years, with demonstrated ownership of complex features or services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in technical architecture, high-level software design, and scalable system patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience deploying agentic frameworks, machine learning models, or supporting backend ML infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing production APIs using FastAPI or a comparable framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying and troubleshooting services in a cloud environment, using containers, CI/CD, logs, metrics, and tracing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work through ambiguous requirements, explain technical tradeoffs, and balance customer needs with long-term system health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication in English and a collaborative approach to working with technical and non-technical colleagues (German is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in building dependable AI applications and the ability to learn new tools and concepts as the field evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience That Would Be a Plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building applications with LLMs, tool calling, agent orchestration, or the Model Context Protocol (MCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluating agent behavior using representative datasets and regression checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on multi-tenant SaaS systems, authorization boundaries, sandboxed execution, or defenses against prompt injection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with technologies such as Pydantic AI, SQLAlchemy, PostgreSQL, message queues, object storage, and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do not need experience with every technology listed. We value strong engineering judgment, ownership, and the ability to learn.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
