&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2190 - Software Engineer - Web Platform (Mid-level)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Code, we create digital experiences with heart - blending creativity, technology and insight to build products people love and businesses rely on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not just building software; we’re helping our partners shape better digital futures through collaboration, experimentation and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Professional / Mid-Level Software Engineer, you’ll join a cross-disciplinary product team responsible for building and evolving modern web platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on engineering role with a strong focus on &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;C#/.NET,&lt;/strong&gt; working across the services, APIs, integrations and application architecture that power modern websites and digital products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll contribute production code, collaborate closely with experienced engineers and help deliver accessible, secure, observable, performant and maintainable software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams build distributed, composable web applications using technologies including: TypeScript, Node.js, C#/.NET, React and cloud services, predominantly within &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Azure&lt;/strong&gt;. You don’t need to be a specialist in every part of the stack, but you should be comfortable understanding how the pieces of a modern web platform fit together - from browser and application code through APIs, integrations and the cloud infrastructure they run on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work alongside other engineers, designers, delivery managers and client stakeholders, supported by experienced engineers while continuing to develop your technical skills, engineering judgement and understanding of modern software delivery practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve modern, cloud-hosted web platforms using TypeScript and C#/.NET.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop APIs, backend services, server-side applications and integrations with third-party and SaaS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the web stack, contributing where appropriate to TypeScript and React applications as well as the services behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate technologies such as headless CMS, search, personalisation, analytics and other composable platform services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help design and evolve distributed and composable web architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and contribute to how applications are deployed, configured, monitored and operated in Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cloud infrastructure and services such as application hosting, serverless functions, storage, networking, monitoring and secrets/configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to engineering practices including automated testing, CI/CD, code quality, observability and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to cloud-native applications using modern DevOps and Infrastructure as Code practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure platforms are accessible, performant, secure, resilient, observable and operationally supportable in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineers, designers, delivery managers, strategists and client stakeholders as part of a cross-disciplinary product team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with experienced engineers to develop your technical capability and contribute to technical discussions, implementation decisions and architectural thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the wider engineering discipline at Code by sharing knowledge, learning from others and helping improve how we build and deliver technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d Love to See Experience With:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial experience building modern web applications or web platforms using TypeScript and/or C#/.NET. - &lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working knowledge of both TypeScript and C#/.NET, with stronger experience in at least one. - &lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing APIs, backend services and integrations.- &lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of how modern web applications work across the browser, application, API and infrastructure layers.- &lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience working with applications hosted in Microsoft Azure or a comparable cloud platform.- &lt;strong&gt;Knowledge Essential, Experience desired&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of cloud infrastructure concepts such as application hosting, serverless compute, networking, identity, configuration, secrets, logging and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD, modern DevOps practices and Infrastructure as Code.-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern web technologies such as Node.js and React.- &lt;strong&gt;Desired, not essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of engineering fundamentals including testing, maintainability, performance, security, observability and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with distributed or composable architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with headless CMS, search, personalisation or similar web platform technologies is desirable but not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within collaborative cross-disciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a willingness to learn from and support others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for building thoughtful, well-engineered digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team and Culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join one of our cross-disciplinary product teams, working alongside Product Strategy, UX, Engineering and Delivery specialists to create meaningful digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Code, we value collaboration, curiosity and continuous improvement. We aim to create an environment where engineers can do their best work, grow their skills and contribute to shaping how we build technology together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Vonage and help us innovate cloud communications for businesses worldwide!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vonage Communications APIs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an emerging leader in the $10B+ communications API market, we empower global brands to connect better with their customers, employees, and partners through transformative communications experiences. For example, Vonage API solutions empower organizations to build their custom omnichannel communications structure. This allows them to reach and engage customers on their preferred schedule and channels including voice, video, and messaging. Think of a rideshare service instantly connecting with customers, hospital staff conducting remote monitoring, customers verifying their identity before completing a purchase, AI virtual agents servicing customers around the clock, and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role matters:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Director you’ll build new relationships (100% hunter role) with organizations as you target high-growth digital, cloud software companies, and large enterprises. Vonage serves the hottest companies that are building communications into their unique customer experience to differentiate their businesses, and we are looking for leaders who love to work with innovators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory Management and Revenue Generation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and drive sales strategies, discuss industry trends with strong focus on new logo opportunity creation and prospecting mindset. This is a 100% hunter role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze assigned account base to determine focus accounts for prospecting and creation of opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and present sales and revenue forecasts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute business development plans to drive revenue and profits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the sales organization to ensure timely and accurate quote provision and order processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering and technical teams on project scope, managing and reconciling demands across diverse functional teams to achieve desired results for the benefit of the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support implementation through ongoing and supportive customer contact, ensuring a smooth transition to customer success management post-implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience selling to large Multinational Enterprise companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of International Messaging (SMS, WABA ETC), Voice and Video products and solutions in SaaS or PaaS models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building solid relationships with mid-level and senior executives across business, marketing and technology teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience partnering with a strong PreSales Consultant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter attitude, creativity and curiosity with the focus and openness it takes to work both independently and collaboratively across the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience we consider a plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing a solution-oriented sales approach over the full delivery lifecycle, driving company growth by consistently growing and maintaining a healthy new business pipeline that will meet and aggressively exceed targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the pre-sales team to aid in designing innovative CPaaS solutions for prospects looking to migrate their Communication Infrastructure into the Cloud, integrating APIs into their customer experience flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanently checking the best set of actions to deliver against the revenue plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to and building the regional plan, with clear focus on quick execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurate and timely forecasting, acting as a business leader to build a solid, predictable and recurring revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;_9k2iva0 p8i6j0c _1ibi0s314 heading3 _9k2iva1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you&#39;ll benefit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;There are many benefits to working at Vonage, including exciting work, career advancement opportunities, and a collaborative work environment. In addition, we offer the following local benefits for the UK:&lt;span class=&quot;tk0j8o1 _1ibi0s31a _1ibi0s3en&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rj0:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3ec _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://ericssonab70331551vonagepro-my.sharepoint.com/:w:/g/personal/james_burgess_vonage_com/IQDCXe72NvInSqHXaIUNW3CQAfxrLt2qNT7ABIyGL4nzy-k&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;1&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j07 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Private Medical Insurance (BUPA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Group Income Protection (Metlife)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Group Pension Plan (Legal &amp;amp; General)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Group Life Insurance (Utmost)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Discretionary Time Off (DTO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Volunteer Time (VTO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Ericsson Care Line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;Additional benefits and perks will be shared and discussed with you by the recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-YB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;There’s no perfect candidate.&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t need all the preferred qualifications to make a valuable impact on our team. Our employees and customers come from diverse backgrounds, so if you&#39;re passionate about what you could achieve at Vonage, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn how we process your personal data during the recruitment process, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vonage.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vonage is a global cloud communications leader. And your talent will further help brands - such as Airbnb, Viber, WhatsApp, and Snapchat - accelerate their digital transformation through our fully programmable-based unified communications, contact center solutions, and communications APIs. Ready to innovate? Then join us today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Note: The purpose of this profile is to provide a general summary of essential responsibilities for the position and is not meant as an exhaustive list. Assignments may differ for individuals within the same role based on business conditions, departmental need or geographic location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing Manager – In-Store - f/m/d&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Lille or Paris&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Decathlon Digital, we are building the world&#39;s biggest digital sports platform. Within the &lt;strong&gt;In-Store domain&lt;/strong&gt;, our mission is to digitize and enable the elevation of the physical retail experience across our thousands of stores worldwide. We build the digital tools that empower our store teammates and provide a seamless, frictionless omnichannel journey for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; with a strong Go-To-Market focus to maximize the business and operational impact of our in-store digital solutions. Your flagship challenge will be orchestrating the global rollout of our &lt;strong&gt;next-generation checkout system&lt;/strong&gt;, a highly strategic transformation aimed at reducing friction, empowering teammates, and bridging the gap between digital and physical commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Go-To-Market (GTM):&lt;/strong&gt; Plan, orchestrate, and fully own the global launch strategies for critical in-store solutions (especially the new checkout system). You will design scalable GTM playbooks to ensure smooth deployment and high adoption across all geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge product &amp;amp; retail operations (Enablement):&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the ultimate facilitator between central digital teams and local store operations. You will simplify complex technical changes, build educational frameworks, and empower our retail leaders to drive sustainable adoption on the shop floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feed the roadmap with insights:&lt;/strong&gt; centralize feedback from store teammates and customers. You will deliver actionable market and user insights (e.g., checkout friction analysis, retail tech benchmarks) to the Product teams to ensure our solutions perfectly match the physical retail reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure &amp;amp; optimize:&lt;/strong&gt; participate in the&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tracking of the operational impact of new in-store features (e.g., checkout time reduction, teammate satisfaction), gather field feedback, and ensure continuous iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM &amp;amp; PMM Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; proven experience in executing complex, high-impact Go-to-Market strategies, ideally for physical retail, omnichannel, or point-of-sale (POS) environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail affinity:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a deep understanding of physical retail dynamics and the specific challenges faced by store teammates and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; pedagogy:&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at aligning Product, Business, and Retail Operations teams, turning technical complexity into clear, actionable pedagogy for the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; analytical mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to turn operational KPIs and in-store feedback into concrete product recommendations and activation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent English is mandatory for this international role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work organization in our Lille or Paris tech hubs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-impact role at the heart of Decathlon’s omnichannel transformation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equipment provided (Mac or Windows) in line with our societal commitments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and development (technical certifications, internal training);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remuneration package (employee profit-sharing, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our commitment to inclusion and accessibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams. We encourage people of all backgrounds and abilities to apply. Selection process adjustments can be requested confidentially via the application form.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
